{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.12},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.8,"end":30.72},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.96,"end":44.56}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.4,"text":"理想正弦波只包含一個頻率。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.88,"end":6.08,"text":"方波與鋸齒波還包含額外諧波，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.427,"end":9.68,"text":"因此基頻相同時仍有不同音色。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.16,"end":11.92,"text":"即使重複速率不變，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.24,"end":15.12,"text":"單個週期的形狀也會影響聲音。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.8,"end":21.68,"text":"在 220 Hz、低振幅下切換正弦波、方波與鋸齒波。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.16,"end":23.2,"text":"各聽一小段，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.44,"end":25.84,"text":"比較圖上邊緣和斜面。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.12,"end":30.72,"text":"兩個 220 Hz 的音為何聽起來不同？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.96,"end":36.72,"text":"兩個 220 Hz 的音為何聽起來不同？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.92,"end":41.68,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.08,"end":44.56,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}